# Xcode-related
**/dgph
**/xcuserdata/

# SwiftPM's lockfile, which Flutter regenerates from `pubspec.lock` on every
# build. `pubspec.lock` is the real pin — this one is derived from it plus the
# macOS plugin list, and Xcode rewrites it whenever it resolves. Committing it
# would only give the tree a file that goes dirty on its own.
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/
